# Moogles' Valor: "For each creature you control, create a 1/2 white Moogle creature token with lifelink. Then creatures you control gain
# indestructible until end of turn." Bot1 has two Ornithopters, Bot2 one (not counted): two Moogles are made (the count is taken before
# the tokens exist), and "Then" the two Ornithopters and both new Moogles - but not Bot2's Ornithopter - are indestructible.
# On Bot2's turn the effect has ended.

